  "_comment": "Negative: a materialized carrier-local fragment whose oa:hasSource contradicts its own URN. The URN encodes artifact-a; the node declares artifact-b. Every rule that leans on oa:hasSource — the same-Artifact evidence rule above all — would then be reading a source the identifier denies, and the offsets would be counted against a document the digest never covered. The node a URN expands to is a mechanical expansion, so an unfaithful one is a defect rather than a variant (§4.2)."
